COMPILING AND RUNNING 

ASSUMPTIONS:
The code will not create or insert starting data. To do this, please use the provided code found in Database.sql to create the table and insert data through pgAdmin4.  
To connect to the database, the code will ask for the database name and your password to your account. 

TO RUN: 
1. This program requires that psycopg2 be installed. If this has already been downloaded, skip the next step. 
2. To do this, in the termainal run "python -m pip install psycopg2"
    Note: for me I had to use "py" instead of "python"
3. Once psychopg2 has been downloaded, navigate to the folder containing the provided code. 
4. Now in the folder, in the terminal, enter "python question1.py" (Note: for me again, I have to use "py" instead of "python")

